# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# AW-052/AW-054/AW-059: the save panel is REACHED -- Find's Save with
# nothing attached asks WHERE -- and it checks its destination, asks
# before replacing, and takes a dropped file as an answer.
wait 10
key f ctrl
wait 6
key z
wait 2
click 642 405
wait 6
note Return takes the seeded name into the home folder
key Return
wait 8
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/query
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/query z
note reopened, a dropped file navigates the panel and lends its name
click 642 405
wait 6
press 85 138
wait 2
move 300 300
wait 2
move 400 300
wait 2
release 400 300
wait 5
note the panel now says a.txt in /tmp/trk_script: saving must ASK first
key Return
wait 5
expect-alert Replace
note Cancel is first: Escape declines and the file is unharmed
key Escape
wait 3
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_script/a.txt hi
key Return
wait 5
key r
wait 8
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_script/a.txt v4
quit
